          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/scylla-migrator/pulls/5",
          "merged_at": "2022-03-18T20:51:07Z"
        },
        "body": "This PR has been verified on staging.\r\n\r\nMessages table has collection type column field. So preserveTimestamps has to be false.\r\nIntroduce static writeTTLInS and writeWritetimestampInuS configs to enforce a single TTL or writetimestamp for all written records to target cluster.\r\nIf writeTTLInS is not set, there is no TTL on the record in the target cluster.",
