        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/scylla-migrator/pulls/4",
          "merged_at": null
        },
        "body": "This is just a PR to hack scylla-migrator so that it can fit our requirements on messages table migration:\r\n1. Skip copying data in messages table from cassandra to scylla if the bucket is bigger than the configured bucket value.\r\n2. Pick a write time stamp that is before we read the chunk from the token range and use that timestamp on the row written to scylla",
